Q9:
Explain how you could use a custom View in Android. Why might you create one?

A:
Custom Views are used when built-in widgets don’t meet your design needs.
How to create:
- Extend View (or a subclass like TextView).
- Override constructors to initialize.
- Override onDraw(Canvas canvas) to draw custom shapes or graphics.
